+   $$ AA = P[P[XI] + YI] $$
+   $$ AB = P[P[XI] + YI + 1] $$
+   $$ BA = P[P[XI + 1] + YI] $$
+   $$ BB = P[P[XI + 1] + YI + 1] $$
